  - m_Id: 133160999
    m_Localized: Input Log
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133161000
    m_Localized: Write every key event, drum press and judgment to the log, to find lost hits. Needs Log Level Info or Debug; leave it off otherwise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
