  - m_Id: 133161112
    m_Localized: The music coming out of the speakers now. Autoplay drums start early to match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133161113
    m_Localized: The music handed to the device now. The picture runs ahead by the output latency.
